      "trackName": "Stack - Watch Tetro",
      "description": "Drop, match, and blast your way to the top in Watch Tetro, the ultimate Tetris-inspired arcade game crafted for Apple Watch!\n\nGameplay Highlights\n• Classic falling-block mechanics\n• Neon bomb power-ups for explosive clears\n• Crown your score on the leaderboard\n• Smooth Digital Crown controls\n• Quick, satisfying rounds for on-the-go play\n\nPower-Up Fun\nCollect and activate bomb blocks to wipe rows in style with glowing effects and satisfying haptics.\n\nCompete & Conquer\nChase the high score and earn your crown! Track progress with Game Center support.\n\nDesigned for Watch\nFully playable on your wrist, optimized for Apple Watch Series 4 and above. No iPhone required during gameplay.",
